meta {
	name: AccessRestriction
	seq: 10
}

auth {
	mode: inherit
}

docs {
	BDD scenarios for the per-request access-restriction resource attribute (urn:altinn:authorization:access-restriction).

	Each scenario pairs requests that show where access is permitted and where it is not,
	so the effect of the access-restriction value (or of its validation) is visible.
	Each scenario's own folder docs describe its exact requests.

	Values other than None require the altinn:authorization/authorize.admin scope.
}
